  "bio": "Ezra Buccellato is renowned for their meticulous fineline tattoo work, which is highly sought after in Philadelphia. They operate with the highest level of professionalism, which is evident in their clear communication and booking process through the Central Tattoo Studio’s website. Ezra's dedication to maintaining a professional relationship with clients is reflected by their preference to handle all inquiries formally rather than through direct messages.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, United States\n\n𝐓𝐚𝐭𝐭𝐨𝐨𝐢𝐧𝐠 @centraltattoostudio 𝐏𝐡𝐢𝐥𝐚𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐩𝐡𝐢𝐚\n𝑾𝒆𝒍𝒄𝒐𝒎𝒆 𝑨𝒍𝒍",
